{"segment_id": "m001_s01", "meeting_id": "meeting_001", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 45000, "text": "今天先确认星河会议平台的第一版范围。我们要让用户上传或导入会议结果，然后能够查询一场会议，也能够查询多场会议。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m001_s02", "meeting_id": "meeting_001", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_02", "start_ms": 55000, "end_ms": 95000, "text": "第一版先接入 Tingwu 的转写输出，不重新开发 ASR。输入要统一成会议、说话人、时间点、文本和置信度。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m001_s03", "meeting_id": "meeting_001", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_03", "start_ms": 110000, "end_ms": 145000, "text": "事实和证据放在 PostgreSQL，音频和原始文件放在对象存储。向量检索只能作为索引，不能当作最终事实。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m001_s04", "meeting_id": "meeting_001", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "start_ms": 165000, "end_ms": 205000, "text": "每场会议至少要输出摘要、章节、事实、决策、待办、风险、热词和可回放的原文证据。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m001_s05", "meeting_id": "meeting_001", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_02", "start_ms": 220000, "end_ms": 260000, "text": "我负责把三场已有的 Tingwu JSON 整理成统一格式，周五之前提交第一批 Fixture。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m001_s06", "meeting_id": "meeting_001", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_03", "start_ms": 260000, "end_ms": 320000, "text": "主要风险是直接把模型生成的摘要当成事实。所有结论必须保存来源会议、片段和时间点。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m002_s01", "meeting_id": "meeting_002", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 45000, "text": "今天比较 RAGFlow、Graphiti、Mem0 和 Hindsight，重点看它们能不能覆盖我们的会议记忆需求。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m002_s02", "meeting_id": "meeting_002", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_02", "start_ms": 55000, "end_ms": 95000, "text": "RAGFlow 很适合做文档解析和检索演示。为了本周能看到效果，我建议暂时把 RAGFlow 作为检索主链路。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m002_s03", "meeting_id": "meeting_002", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_03", "start_ms": 110000, "end_ms": 145000, "text": "Graphiti 适合做实体关系和时间变化，Mem0 与 Hindsight 可以研究长期记忆，但它们都不应该直接决定产品事实。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m002_s04", "meeting_id": "meeting_002", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "start_ms": 165000, "end_ms": 205000, "text": "PostgreSQL 必须保存 Claim、证据、权限和状态。向量库、图数据库和 Memory 项目都只能做可重建投影。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m002_s05", "meeting_id": "meeting_002", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_02", "start_ms": 220000, "end_ms": 260000, "text": "那先记录一个临时决定：演示版使用 RAGFlow 做主要检索，等有固定数据以后再比较自研检索。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m002_s06", "meeting_id": "meeting_002", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_03", "start_ms": 260000, "end_ms": 320000, "text": "我来整理这些项目的边界和适配接口，重点记录哪些能力不能交给第三方。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m003_s01", "meeting_id": "meeting_003", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 45000, "text": "转写还原块只负责谁在什么时间说了什么，不负责摘要、待办和跨会议记忆。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m003_s02", "meeting_id": "meeting_003", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_02", "start_ms": 55000, "end_ms": 95000, "text": "统一协议里的每个片段都要有 segment_id、speaker_id、start_ms、end_ms、text 和 confidence。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m003_s03", "meeting_id": "meeting_003", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_03", "start_ms": 110000, "end_ms": 145000, "text": "Tingwu 的原始 JSON 只能由适配器读取，后面的模块只能读取 TranscriptBundle。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m003_s04", "meeting_id": "meeting_003", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "start_ms": 165000, "end_ms": 205000, "text": "说话人如果还没有真实姓名，就保留 speaker_01 这样的稳定候选，不能让模型猜姓名。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m003_s05", "meeting_id": "meeting_003", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_02", "start_ms": 220000, "end_ms": 260000, "text": "原始转写和规范化转写都要保留版本。后续换模型重新抽取时，不能覆盖原始证据。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m003_s06", "meeting_id": "meeting_003", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_03", "start_ms": 260000, "end_ms": 320000, "text": "这一块的验收是时间点连续、片段引用可定位、模型版本可追踪，暂时不验证 ASR 字准率。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m004_s01", "meeting_id": "meeting_004", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 45000, "text": "单会议理解需要从 TranscriptBundle 生成 MeetingArtifactBundle。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m004_s02", "meeting_id": "meeting_004", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_02", "start_ms": 55000, "end_ms": 95000, "text": "LLM 可以提取摘要、章节、事实、决策、行动项、风险和未解决问题，但必须按照固定结构输出。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m004_s03", "meeting_id": "meeting_004", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_03", "start_ms": 110000, "end_ms": 145000, "text": "我们用 Pydantic 校验字段。每一条事实、决策和待办都必须包含 evidence_segment_ids。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m004_s04", "meeting_id": "meeting_004", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "start_ms": 165000, "end_ms": 205000, "text": "没有证据的模型输出只能进入候选区或人工审核队列，不能直接进入当前记忆。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m004_s05", "meeting_id": "meeting_004", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_02", "start_ms": 220000, "end_ms": 260000, "text": "热词、词云和章节可以从结构化结果生成，不需要再调用一个独立的聊天 Agent。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m004_s06", "meeting_id": "meeting_004", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_03", "start_ms": 260000, "end_ms": 320000, "text": "抽取结果要记录模型名称、Prompt 版本、输入哈希、Token 和成本，方便复现和比较。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m005_s01", "meeting_id": "meeting_005", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 45000, "text": "跨会议记忆要把事实和决策转换为 Claim，而不是只把整段摘要塞进向量库。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m005_s02", "meeting_id": "meeting_005", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_02", "start_ms": 55000, "end_ms": 95000, "text": "Claim 至少包含 subject、predicate、object、status、valid_from、valid_to、来源会议和证据片段。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m005_s03", "meeting_id": "meeting_005", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_03", "start_ms": 110000, "end_ms": 145000, "text": "当新的决策替代旧的决策时，旧 Claim 不能删除，而是标记 superseded，并链接到新的 Claim。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m005_s04", "meeting_id": "meeting_005", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "start_ms": 165000, "end_ms": 205000, "text": "Graphiti 可以作为关系图投影，Mem0 和 Hindsight 可以作为记忆召回实验，但 PostgreSQL 才是事实源。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m005_s05", "meeting_id": "meeting_005", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_02", "start_ms": 220000, "end_ms": 260000, "text": "模型只能提出候选 Claim，Go 校验器检查租户、字段、证据、时间范围和关系规则。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m005_s06", "meeting_id": "meeting_005", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_03", "start_ms": 260000, "end_ms": 320000, "text": "下一步先实现 active、superseded 和历史时间线三种状态，暂时不做复杂自动实体归并。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m006_s01", "meeting_id": "meeting_006", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 45000, "text": "检索不能只用向量。人名、产品名、型号和日期要使用 PostgreSQL 全文检索。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m006_s02", "meeting_id": "meeting_006", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_02", "start_ms": 55000, "end_ms": 95000, "text": "语义问题使用 pgvector，关键词问题使用 FTS，两路结果合并以后再做重排。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m006_s03", "meeting_id": "meeting_006", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_03", "start_ms": 110000, "end_ms": 145000, "text": "用户问当前决策时，应该先查 Claim 状态，再召回相关会议原文。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m006_s04", "meeting_id": "meeting_006", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "start_ms": 165000, "end_ms": 205000, "text": "最终答案必须返回会议、片段、Speaker、开始时间和结束时间，客户端才能播放证据。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m006_s05", "meeting_id": "meeting_006", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_02", "start_ms": 220000, "end_ms": 260000, "text": "如果检索到的片段不足以支持答案，就返回 no_answer，不能让 LLM 根据常识补全。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m006_s06", "meeting_id": "meeting_006", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_03", "start_ms": 260000, "end_ms": 320000, "text": "查询接口先支持单会议、跨会议、当前状态和历史变化四类问题。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m007_s01", "meeting_id": "meeting_007", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 45000, "text": "多人使用前，所有会议、片段、Claim、向量和对象存储路径都必须关联 tenant_id。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m007_s02", "meeting_id": "meeting_007", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_02", "start_ms": 55000, "end_ms": 95000, "text": "Go API 在进入检索和写入前验证用户、租户和会议权限，Python Worker 不能自行扩大权限范围。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m007_s03", "meeting_id": "meeting_007", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_03", "start_ms": 110000, "end_ms": 145000, "text": "删除会议时要删除 PostgreSQL 记录、FTS、向量、图投影、原始文件和缓存，并保留审计结果。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m007_s04", "meeting_id": "meeting_007", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "start_ms": 165000, "end_ms": 205000, "text": "证据播放链接也必须经过权限检查，不能把对象存储的永久地址返回给客户端。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m007_s05", "meeting_id": "meeting_007", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_02", "start_ms": 220000, "end_ms": 260000, "text": "测试至少包括跨租户泄漏、删除残留、无权限会议定位和过期链接。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m007_s06", "meeting_id": "meeting_007", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_03", "start_ms": 260000, "end_ms": 320000, "text": "我负责写租户过滤和删除验收用例，先用十场 Fixture 做固定回归。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m008_s01", "meeting_id": "meeting_008", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 45000, "text": "部署上先使用 Go API、Python AI Worker、PostgreSQL、MinIO 四个组件，不拆成很多微服务。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m008_s02", "meeting_id": "meeting_008", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_02", "start_ms": 55000, "end_ms": 95000, "text": "Go 负责用户、权限、任务状态、查询和数据库；Python 负责 LLM 抽取、Embedding、Reranker 和回答生成。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m008_s03", "meeting_id": "meeting_008", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_03", "start_ms": 110000, "end_ms": 145000, "text": "批量处理、失败重试和删除传播使用 Temporal，第一版可以先保留接口再启用 Worker。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m008_s04", "meeting_id": "meeting_008", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "start_ms": 165000, "end_ms": 205000, "text": "LiteLLM 统一外部模型和本地模型路由，记录每场会议的输入哈希、Token、延迟和成本。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m008_s05", "meeting_id": "meeting_008", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_02", "start_ms": 220000, "end_ms": 260000, "text": "查询接口要保持无状态，后面可以水平扩展 Go API；Python Worker 根据 CPU、GPU 和队列分别扩展。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m008_s06", "meeting_id": "meeting_008", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_03", "start_ms": 260000, "end_ms": 320000, "text": "第一版先保证十场会议能重复导入、重复抽取和重复查询，性能优化放在有基准数据以后。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m009_s01", "meeting_id": "meeting_009", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 45000, "text": "我们复盘了 RAGFlow 主链路的演示。它能召回文本，但不能负责当前决策、租户权限和完整音频证据。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m009_s02", "meeting_id": "meeting_009", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_02", "start_ms": 55000, "end_ms": 95000, "text": "因此修订之前的临时决定：生产检索核心改为 PostgreSQL FTS 加 pgvector，RAGFlow 只保留为 RAG 基线和对照实验。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m009_s03", "meeting_id": "meeting_009", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_03", "start_ms": 110000, "end_ms": 145000, "text": "Graphiti、Mem0 和 Hindsight 都不能直接成为事实源，只能通过适配器写入候选或可重建投影。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m009_s04", "meeting_id": "meeting_009", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_01", "start_ms": 165000, "end_ms": 205000, "text": "正式架构确定为：Tingwu 输出、Python 单会议理解、Go Claim 校验、PostgreSQL 权威记忆、混合检索和证据回答。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m009_s05", "meeting_id": "meeting_009", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_02", "start_ms": 220000, "end_ms": 260000, "text": "验收必须覆盖单会议、多会议、当前状态、历史替代、引用可播放、no_answer、删除和租户隔离。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m009_s06", "meeting_id": "meeting_009", "tenant_id": "tenant_alpha", "speaker_id": "speaker_03", "start_ms": 260000, "end_ms": 320000, "text": "我负责把这套验收标准写入 queries.jsonl，并记录每次模型和索引版本。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m010_s01", "meeting_id": "meeting_010", "tenant_id": "tenant_beta", "speaker_id": "speaker_04", "start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 45000, "text": "蓝海客户项目今天讨论客户门户的交付时间，不涉及星河会议平台。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m010_s02", "meeting_id": "meeting_010", "tenant_id": "tenant_beta", "speaker_id": "speaker_05", "start_ms": 55000, "end_ms": 95000, "text": "客户门户首版计划使用 React，预算上限是八万元，负责人是李娜。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m010_s03", "meeting_id": "meeting_010", "tenant_id": "tenant_beta", "speaker_id": "speaker_06", "start_ms": 110000, "end_ms": 145000, "text": "合同需要在七月十五日前确认，测试环境由客户方提供。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m010_s04", "meeting_id": "meeting_010", "tenant_id": "tenant_beta", "speaker_id": "speaker_04", "start_ms": 165000, "end_ms": 205000, "text": "这场会议属于 tenant_beta，只有蓝海项目成员可以查看。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m010_s05", "meeting_id": "meeting_010", "tenant_id": "tenant_beta", "speaker_id": "speaker_05", "start_ms": 220000, "end_ms": 260000, "text": "如果后续出现技术变更，要在客户项目自己的会议中记录，不能写入星河平台的 Claim。", "confidence": 1.0}
{"segment_id": "m010_s06", "meeting_id": "meeting_010", "tenant_id": "tenant_beta", "speaker_id": "speaker_06", "start_ms": 260000, "end_ms": 320000, "text": "今天没有讨论星河平台的 ASR、Memory 或检索方案。", "confidence": 1.0}
